desc:
72nd Ave and 114A Street, detached house on the first floor, 2 bed 1 bath, quiet inner street. 
1. School:
    - Heath Elementary School is in neighbor; 
    - Walking distance to Seaquam Secondary School; 
    - Close to Kwantlan Polytechnic University (KPU) Surrey campus.
2. Transportation:
    - 3 min walk to bus stop; 
    - Close to HW 91;
    - 15 min driving to Richmond/Burnaby/New Westminster, 20 min to YVR Airport.
3. Nearby
    - Walk distance to Scottsdale Shopping Center;
    - Near Walmart, Save-On-Foods, Staple, Starbucks, Subway, etc;
    - Close to Cougar Canyon Environmental Reserve.
4. Highlights
    - Separated entrance;
    - Independent bathroom, laundry room and kitchen. 
5. Suitable for people
   - It is suitable for quiet and clean 1~2 adult people with or without a young kid; 
     - Students or working people are welcomed;
     - A student with 1 of the parents are welcomed; 
     - No smoke, no drug and no pet please.
6. Rental and Term
    - Monthly rent: $1600/month + 1/3 electricity & gas bills, or $1700 including everything; 
    - Lease term starts from one year, move in at anytime.
7. Contact
    To make an appointment for viewing, please text to Ms. Han at  show contact info
